OL,3,GNEWSAArtist moved by response to mural 
OL,4,Ato 'best friend'                       
OL,6,FA graffiti artist has said he has been 
OL,7,F"overwhelmed" by the public response to
OL,8,Fa mural he painted in tribute to his   
OL,9,Fbest friend.                           
OL,11,FAndrew 'Rew' Nurse, 42, who was a      
OL,12,Fwell-known street artist and mural     
OL,13,Fpainter in Scarborough, died suddenly  
OL,14,Flast month.                            
OL,16,FBut a lasting tribute to his memory has
OL,17,Fsprung up on a wall close to a bridge  
OL,18,Fnext to the town's Sainsbury's car     
OL,19,Fpark, courtesy of fellow creative Ben  
OL,20,FWalgate.                               
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
