OL,3,GNEWSAArtist moved by response to mural 
OL,4,Ato 'best friend'                       
OL,6,FWalgate, 39, said Rew, who worked with 
OL,7,Flocal schools and his beloved          
OL,8,FScarborough Athletic and was also known
OL,9,Fby the tag name 'Nerv', had been       
OL,10,Fsomeone "everyone" in the area knew.   
